	(text "USB-C input and power tree"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 18.0 22.0 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(face "JetBrains Mono")
				(size 4.5 4.5)
				(bold yes)
				(color 0 40 90 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "cd1e0358-5111-5e34-a09a-7b0ad8190a53")
	)
	(text "One USB-C port feeds three rails and the 5 V blower. Left of the barrier is USB ground (DGND); the analog stage floats on AGND = DUT minus."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 18.0 26.5 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(face "JetBrains Mono")
				(size 2.0 2.0)
				(italic yes)
				(color 70 70 70 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "841dbaad-58fd-52df-b08b-882338cb270a")
	)
	(text "CC1 / CC2 5.1k pull-downs = USB-C sink. The MCU reads\nthe CC voltage to learn the source limit: 0.4 V = 500 mA\n(legacy source), 0.9 V = 1.5 A, 1.7 V = 3 A. The whole box\ndraws about 0.45 A with the blower at full speed.\nShield to DGND: a metal enclosure is on the USB side;\nDUT terminals, heatsink hardware and the NTC lug must\nnot touch it."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.27 153.27 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(face "JetBrains Mono")
				(size 2.0 2.0)
				(color 40 40 40 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "d82b5228-1d0e-50ca-bae7-dffad0584e32")
	)
	(text "A   USB-C input: 5 V, data, current advertisement (CC)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 21.05 41.7 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(face "JetBrains Mono")
				(size 2.5 2.5)
				(bold yes)
				(color 0 50 120 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "37cee5d3-64ad-56b1-a3ee-5f02075f561b")
	)
	(text "AGND (analog reference) meets PGND (DUT minus, source\nresistors) ONLY at NT1. Place NT1 at the centre of the four\nRs bottom pads: 1 mR between an Rs and NT1 is 10 mV at 10 A\n(4 % of full scale).\n\nBarrier: DGND side to AGND / PGND side. Rated 150 V DC\nworking (IEC 60664-1 functional, PD2, material group IIIb:\n1.6 mm creepage; IPC-2221B B2: 0.7 mm). Board rule 4 mm,\nno copper crosses on any layer. CA-IS3761 (5 kVrms, 8 mm) and\nthe 1.5 kVDC DC-DC exceed it by far. Float the load on a DUT\nreferenced within 150 V of earth; not for mains work."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.27 251.27 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(face "JetBrains Mono")
				(size 2.0 2.0)
				(color 40 40 40 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "a3df7952-ff5c-551b-ac28-7ceb95f286c9")
	)
	(text "D   Ground star point and the isolation barrier rating"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 21.05 180.13 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(face "JetBrains Mono")
				(size 2.5 2.5)
				(bold yes)
				(color 0 50 120 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "a93b5ba8-52d1-5f9a-83cc-31ae0e9debef")
	)
	(text "+3V3: MCU, isolator side 1, pull-ups, LED. 60 mA."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 171.27 95.27 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(face "JetBrains Mono")
				(size 2.0 2.0)
				(color 40 40 40 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "39318bc7-c095-50ba-8ae5-22eea340586a")
	)
	(text "BARRIER"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 199.87 163.27 90)
		(effects
			(font
				(face "JetBrains Mono")
				(size 2.0 2.0)
				(bold yes)
				(color 200 0 0 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "db8ac9ca-fcc8-5455-8cd2-e723b2d618da")
	)
	(text "+12V_ISO: op-amps, comparators, pull-ups, 30 mA. PS1 is unregulated: 12 V\nat full load, up to 14 V here; all parts on the rail are rated 16 V or more.\nR12 / C8 filter the 100 kHz ripple (fc 1.5 kHz). +5V_ISO (78L05, 4 %): DAC,\nADC, isolator side 2 and every threshold divider, so OTP, dropout, NTC-open\nand OVP thresholds do not depend on its absolute value; the DAC and ADC\ncarry their own references. VBUS_LK / DGND_LK: VBUS / DGND after the\nJ10-J11 cable. VERIFY the SIP-4 pin order of the module you buy."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 171.27 183.27 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(face "JetBrains Mono")
				(size 2.0 2.0)
				(color 40 40 40 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "9a02000e-a0c5-59a9-afc8-d0bf215b2e5c")
	)
	(text "B   Power tree: VBUS 5 V trunk, two branches, three rails"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 150.59 36.62 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(face "JetBrains Mono")
				(size 2.5 2.5)
				(bold yes)
				(color 0 50 120 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "98ad4c4c-4764-5b2a-8f04-1ae6704e1a76")
	)
	(text "J2 = PC fan pinout on 5 V: 1 GND, 2 +5 V\nswitched by Q1, 3 tach (open collector,\npulled to 3.3 V), 4 PWM 25 kHz. A 5 V 5015\nblower (2 wires) uses pins 1 and 2 and is\non/off through FAN_EN; a 4-wire fan gets\nPWM from Q3 (open-drain, firmware inverts\nthe duty). R11 only for fans without a PWM\npull-up. C3 is the blower bulk capacitor:\nkeep the motor noise on its own VBUS trace."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 319.27 171.27 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(face "JetBrains Mono")
				(size 2.0 2.0)
				(color 40 40 40 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "e1d3c849-b92c-5be3-b659-e19078b8364e")
	)
	(text "C   Blower switch and connector"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 310.61 45.51 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(face "JetBrains Mono")
				(size 2.5 2.5)
				(bold yes)
				(color 0 50 120 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "14d10b24-576c-5815-8fbf-d9be8f2363e6")
	)
